; Private support library shared by the QCheck test suite (test/) and the
; Monolith fuzzing harness (fuzz/). It is deliberately unwrapped so that the
; existing test files can keep referring to the [Theories] module directly
; (they all start with [open Theories]). It depends only on [theo]; in
; particular it does NOT depend on [monolith], so the Phase 1 model self-tests
; in test/ build and run as part of the normal test suite even when monolith is
; not installed.

(library
 (name theo_test_support)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries theo))
